5:[["$","p",null,{"children":"During my internship at Shangrila Informatic, I got my first real taste of Flutter. Here's what actually helped me get up to speed."}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Why Flutter clicked for me"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Flutter's widget-based architecture makes a lot of sense once you stop thinking in terms of HTML and start thinking in terms of composable UI pieces. Everything is a widget — and that consistency is actually a strength."}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"The things nobody tells you"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["State management is where most beginners get lost. I started with ",["$","code",null,{"children":"setState"}]," for simple cases and that was the right call — don't jump to Provider or Riverpod until you actually need it."]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"What I'd tell myself starting out"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Read the Flutter docs properly. They're genuinely good. And build something small end-to-end before trying to understand everything."}]]
